  "description": "Capable, lightweight Aluminum Gravel Road bike performance, wide gearing, and upright comfort, all within a budget. The light/strong aluminum frame with semi-compact geometry is responsive yet comfortable with a smooth feel over long rides. Lots of custom features: top-tube bento box attachment points, fork trifecta braze ons and braze ons to mount your bottle cages.\n\nGenuine Shimano drivetrain is smooth, shifting. Disc brakes are sure stopping in nearly any weather. Great for new to experienced riders, perfect for fitness or commuting the Motobecane Gravel X1 XTL series have real performance and exceptional value. Customers say these are up to half the price of similar Trek gravel roadbikes or Giant adventure bicycles.",
